1
00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:04,803
Compliance readiness can become scattered across spreadsheets and inboxes.

2
00:00:04,803 --> 00:00:08,805
FeDril brings the work into one No-CUI operating view.

3
00:00:10,105 --> 00:00:14,624
Teams can see high-priority obligations, ownership, due dates,

4
00:00:14,624 --> 00:00:19,898
and overdue remediation without rebuilding the status picture by hand.

5
00:00:21,198 --> 00:00:28,364
Non-sensitive evidence metadata can be associated with readiness work while the product keeps its current No-CUI

6
00:00:28,364 --> 00:00:30,572
boundary visible.

7
00:00:31,872 --> 00:00:38,479
Tenant-scoped permissions and audit history help reviewers understand relevant activity and keep follow-up work

8
00:00:38,479 --> 00:00:40,344
accountable.

9
00:00:41,644 --> 00:00:46,145
Give leadership a reviewable readiness summary and keep the next action visible.

10
00:00:46,145 --> 00:00:48,645
Schedule a FeDril demonstration.
